      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suppose we can turn off CHURN MODE, it\u0027s not affecting speed, just consumes power to make it harder to detect when TRNG is in use. Disabling it may improve H1 power consumption a bit.\nRegarding SLICE_MAX_UPPER_LIMIT \u003d 1 - i\u0027m not sure what kind of post-processing it is. If it just enables 2-bit symbols, thats fine.",
